OL,3,GNEWSADog rescued after two days lost
OL,4,Aunderground
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old parson Russell Terrier
OL,7,Fhas been rescued after he was trapped
OL,8,Funderground for two days.
OL,10,FCello was out walking with his owner,
OL,11,FStephen Smith, in Hoveringham,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, when he wandered off
OL,13,Ftowards a badger sett and became lost
OL,14,Fin the network of tunnels.
OL,16,FRescuers first had to obtain a licence
OL,17,Ffrom Natural England before digging
OL,18,Fnear the sett, to avoid disturbing the
OL,19,Fbadgers or causing the tunnels to
OL,20,Fcollapse.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
