OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSADog rescued after two days lost
OL,4,Aunderground
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers from Notts Lost Dogs,
OL,7,Falongside crews from Newark Fire
OL,8,FStation, carefully excavated part of
OL,9,Fthe sett and eventually located Cello
OL,10,Fabout 60cm (2ft) underground.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
